OL,3,AEthiopia and Tigray accuse each of
OL,4,Alaunching offensives, fuelling fears of
OL,5,Anew war
OL,6,
OL,7,FEthiopia's government and the party in
OL,8,Fcontrol of the northern region of
OL,9,FTigray have accused each other of
OL,10,Flaunching offensives, escalating fears
OL,11,Fof a return to full-scale conflict.
OL,13,FGetachew Reda, a cabinet minister and
OL,14,Fadviser to Ethiopia's prime minister,
OL,15,Fsaid Tigrayan fighters had taken
OL,16,Fcontrol of federally administered
OL,17,Fairports in Tigray and launched
OL,18,Foffensives in neighbouring Afar and
OL,19,FAmhara regions.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
